    "text": "<p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>It is given that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><msub><mi>x</mi><m